        "text": "* A generic op-amp, written for this example: a transconductance stage into 1Meg and 15.9p gives 100k of gain\n* falling from 10 Hz, so 1 MHz of gain-bandwidth; diodes hold the inner node within the supplies, and a buffer with\n* 75 Ohm drives the output\nRIN INP INN 1Meg\nG1 0 INT INP INN {GAIN/1Meg}\nRP INT 0 1Meg\nCP INT 0 15.9p\nDHIGH INT VP DCLAMP\nDLOW VN INT DCLAMP\nE2 DRIVE 0 INT 0 1\nROUT DRIVE OUT {RO}\n.model DCLAMP D(IS=1e-15)\n"
